msgstr "啟用時，<code>%(diff)s</code> 通知權杖將顯示 AI 摘要而非原始差異（Diff）。使用 <code>%(raw_diff)s</code> 以一律獲取原始內容。"

#: changedetectionio/blueprint/settings/templates/settings_llm_tab.html
